; RECTANG (0.8.1-PT35, #932): directions from Rotation with cardinalSinCos (REGOLE-NUMERICHE.md,
; section 2, point 1; D8): a quarter turn gives exact vertices, hence absolute tolerance 0.
; Vertices by hand as the card says: P, P + dx u, the opposite corner, P + dy v. 90 with Dimensions
; 40 x 20 towards -10,50 (u = 0,1, v = -1,0); 180 with the corner typed 60,-10 (projections 40 and
; 10 on u = -1,0 and v = 0,-1); 0 resets the rotation. The mode and the proposal are 90 and 180.
!tolerance absolute 0
RECTANG
0,0
R
90
D
40
20
-10,50
RECTANG
100,0
R
180
60,-10
RECTANG
200,0
R
0
240,20
